245
00:20:08,620 --> 00:20:09,480
How's it going?

246
00:20:09,580 --> 00:20:10,300
You look good.

247
00:20:10,480 --> 00:20:11,060
Oh, wow.

248
00:20:11,240 --> 00:20:11,920
Check it out.

249
00:20:12,200 --> 00:20:13,500
A golden dawn robe.

250
00:20:13,740 --> 00:20:14,740
It's the real deal.

251
00:20:15,240 --> 00:20:15,920
Yuna's back!

252
00:20:16,000 --> 00:20:16,480
Yay!

253
00:20:16,600 --> 00:20:16,940
Yay!

254
00:20:17,200 --> 00:20:17,580
Yay!

255
00:20:18,120 --> 00:20:19,520
Hey, what about Asta?

256
00:20:19,900 --> 00:20:20,720
Yeah, Asta!

257
00:20:20,720 --> 00:20:22,180
Yes, of course.

258
00:20:22,260 --> 00:20:23,700
Have you been keeping in touch with him?

259
00:20:23,940 --> 00:20:24,620
I haven't.

260
00:20:24,980 --> 00:20:26,560
Are you going to stay the whole night here?

261
00:20:26,920 --> 00:20:27,880
You will, won't you?

262
00:20:28,220 --> 00:20:28,940
Um, well...

263
00:20:28,940 --> 00:20:30,340
Afraid not.

264
00:20:30,560 --> 00:20:31,800
Our visit will be quick.

265
00:20:32,660 --> 00:20:34,840
We have a time-sensitive mission to complete.

266
00:20:35,060 --> 00:20:35,440
Aw!

267
00:20:35,440 --> 00:20:37,060
Come now, Klaus.

268
00:20:37,160 --> 00:20:39,460
We're not in that much of a rush to be off, are we?

269
00:20:39,920 --> 00:20:42,160
Surely it wouldn't be difficult to spare an hour.

270
00:20:42,700 --> 00:20:43,160
But, sir...

271
00:20:43,820 --> 00:20:44,260
Perfect!

272
00:20:44,660 --> 00:20:46,920
Well, then, this calls for a Hajj feast.

273
00:20:47,120 --> 00:20:48,700
Pot potatoes for everybody!

274
00:20:49,040 --> 00:20:49,680
What do you think?

275
00:20:49,780 --> 00:20:50,580
Sounds good, huh?

276
00:20:50,920 --> 00:20:52,280
Please, make yourselves at home.

277
00:20:52,620 --> 00:20:53,300
Come on in.

278
00:20:53,300 --> 00:20:54,260
Thank you.

279
00:20:54,480 --> 00:20:56,280
What a marvelous church you have.

280
00:20:56,640 --> 00:20:59,280
I don't think I've ever seen one this tiny before.

281
00:20:59,620 --> 00:21:00,680
It's so adorable.

282
00:21:01,060 --> 00:21:01,600
Adorable?

283
00:21:02,080 --> 00:21:04,120
Almost like a children's playhouse.

284
00:21:04,240 --> 00:21:04,880
Brr!

285
00:21:05,880 --> 00:21:08,820
You have to tell us all about the Magic Knights, Yuna.

286
00:21:09,220 --> 00:21:10,540
Yeah, tell us!

287
00:21:10,660 --> 00:21:11,400
Tell us!

288
00:21:12,120 --> 00:21:15,400
How did I let myself get dragged to some shabby church?

289
00:21:23,300 --> 00:21:53,280
How did I let myself get dragged to some shabby church?

290
00:21:53,300 --> 00:21:58,820
僕は眩しくて目を閉じる。

291
00:22:00,480 --> 00:22:07,860
散々考えた革命は手の中におかしいだろう。

292
00:22:08,080 --> 00:22:13,440
笑いたければ笑えばいいから。

293
00:22:14,040 --> 00:22:20,880
残された僕らはなにかになりたくて。

294
00:22:20,880 --> 00:22:27,880
I'm going to be the same morning

295
00:22:27,880 --> 00:22:30,880
I'm going to choose the next day

296
00:22:30,880 --> 00:22:35,880
I'm going to be the same day

297
00:22:35,880 --> 00:22:38,880
I'm going to be the same day

298
00:22:50,880 --> 00:22:56,880
CLOP pluck!

299
00:22:56,880 --> 00:23:01,880
Sekei's HA HA! Lesson Part Two

300
00:23:01,880 --> 00:23:04,880
Wait we're doing this again?

301
00:23:04,880 --> 00:23:06,880
OF COURSE! What did you expect?

302
00:23:06,880 --> 00:23:07,880
There's a great deal more work to be done

303
00:23:07,880 --> 00:23:10,680
if you wish to attain Ha HA-Hood

304
00:23:10,680 --> 00:23:12,880
Your shooting star is totally awesome

305
00:23:12,880 --> 00:23:14,880
I'm glad someone appreciates it

306
00:23:14,880 --> 00:23:17,880
Well... yeah especially that thing on the front

307
00:23:17,880 --> 00:23:18,880
So coooooool

308
00:23:18,880 --> 00:23:21,000
You're getting closer to ha-ha-hood.

309
00:23:21,120 --> 00:23:23,380
I see now. That's what ha-ha is.

310
00:23:23,680 --> 00:23:26,060
Yes! Now you too are ha-ha!

311
00:23:26,420 --> 00:23:30,560
Ha-ha-ha-ha-ha-ha! Ha-ha-ha-ha-ha-ha-ha-ha-ha-ha-ha-ha!

312
00:23:30,680 --> 00:23:32,020
Are all men such idiots?

313
00:23:34,820 --> 00:23:37,880
Damn that Yuno. Such an impertinent newcomer.

314
00:23:38,240 --> 00:23:42,760
He had better learn to respect his superiors or I will be held responsible for my actions.

315
00:23:43,240 --> 00:23:47,400
Black Clover, page 13. The Wizard King saw. Continued.

316
00:23:47,400 --> 00:23:49,520
My magic is never giving up!

